{"title": "High Security Vault nº3 Key", "pageid": 33520, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/High_Security_Vault_nº3_Key", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items", "Keys"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Counting_House_Vault_n%C2%BA3_Key\" title=\"Counting House Vault nº3 Key\">Counting House Vault nº3 Key</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Counting_House_Safe_n%C2%BA3_Key\" title=\"Counting House Safe nº3 Key\">Counting House Safe nº3 Key</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Key_Silver_A.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Key_Silver_A.png/300px-Key_Silver_A.png.webp, /w/images/0/06/Key_Silver_A.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"High Security Vault nº3 Key image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Key_Silver_A.png/300px-Key_Silver_A.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Key_Silver_A.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">High Security Vault nº3 Key</span></a> is a miscellaneous <a href=\"/wiki/Story_Item\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Story Item\">Story Item</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/D